
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">

  <title>Free Online Puzzle Games | Toolnes</title>
  <meta name="description" content="Play free online puzzle games on Toolnes, including word search, Sudoku, mazes, word scramble, bingo, and 2048.">
  <meta name="robots" content="index, follow">
  <link rel="canonical" href="https://toolnes.netlify.app/puzzles/">

  <style>
    * {
      box-sizing: border-box;
    }

    html {
      scroll-behavior: smooth;
    }

    body {
      margin: 0;
      font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
      color: #1e293b;
      background: #f8fafc;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }

    a {
      color: inherit;
      text-decoration: none;
    }

    .site-header {
      background: #ffffff;
      border-bottom: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
      padding: 18px 20px;
    }

    .header-inner {
      max-width: 1150px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 20px;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
    }

    .logo {
      font-size: 27px;
      font-weight: 800;
      color: #2563eb;
      letter-spacing: -1px;
    }

    .main-nav {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 22px;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
    }

    .main-nav a {
      font-size: 15px;
      font-weight: 600;
      color: #475569;
    }

    .main-nav a:hover,
    .main-nav a.active {
      color: #2563eb;
    }

    .container {
      width: min(1150px, calc(100% - 36px));
      margin: 0 auto;
    }

    .hero {
      padding: 55px 0 35px;
      text-align: center;
    }

    .hero-label {
      display: inline-block;
      margin-bottom: 12px;
      padding: 6px 13px;
      border-radius: 30px;
      background: #dbeafe;
      color: #1d4ed8;
      font-size: 13px;
      font-weight: 700;
    }

    h1 {
      margin: 0 0 15px;
      color: #0f172a;
      font-size: clamp(32px, 5vw, 46px);
      line-height: 1.2;
      letter-spacing: -1.3px;
    }

    .hero p {
      max-width: 680px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      color: #64748b;
      font-size: 17px;
    }

    .section-heading {
      margin: 12px 0 22px;
      font-size: 25px;
      color: #0f172a;
    }

    .games-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
      gap: 22px;
      width: 100%;
      margin: 0 0 55px;
    }

    .game-card {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: flex-start;
      min-width: 0;
      min-height: 255px;
      padding: 24px;
      overflow-wrap: anywhere;
      background: #ffffff;
      border: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
      border-radius: 16px;
      box-shadow: 0 5px 18px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.05);
      transition: transform 0.2s ease, box-shadow 0.2s ease;
    }

    .game-card:hover {
      transform: translateY(-4px);
      box-shadow: 0 12px 28px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.09);
    }

    .game-icon {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      width: 55px;
      height: 55px;
      margin-bottom: 17px;
      border-radius: 14px;
      background: #eff6ff;
      font-size: 29px;
    }

    .game-card h2 {
      margin: 0 0 10px;
      color: #0f172a;
      font-size: 20px;
      line-height: 1.35;
    }

    .game-card p {
      margin: 0 0 22px;
      color: #64748b;
      font-size: 15px;
    }

    .card-action {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      margin-top: auto;
      padding: 10px 16px;
      border-radius: 9px;
      background: #2563eb;
      color: #ffffff;
      font-size: 14px;
      font-weight: 700;
      transition: background 0.2s ease;
    }

    .card-action:hover {
      background: #1d4ed8;
    }

    .card-action.disabled {
      background: #e2e8f0;
      color: #64748b;
      cursor: default;
    }

    .info-section {
      margin-bottom: 55px;
      padding: 28px;
      background: #ffffff;
      border: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
      border-radius: 16px;
    }

    .info-section h2 {
      margin-top: 0;
      color: #0f172a;
    }

    .info-section p {
      margin-bottom: 0;
      color: #64748b;
    }

    .site-footer {
      padding: 25px 20px;
      background: #ffffff;
      border-top: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
      text-align: center;
      color: #64748b;
      font-size: 14px;
    }

    .site-footer a {
      color: #2563eb;
    }

    @media (max-width: 800px) {
      .games-grid {
        grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
      }

      .hero {
        padding-top: 42px;
      }
    }

    @media (max-width: 540px) {
      .header-inner {
        justify-content: center;
      }

      .main-nav {
        justify-content: center;
        gap: 15px;
      }

      .games-grid {
        grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr);
        gap: 16px;
      }

      .game-card {
        min-height: 230px;
        padding: 21px;
      }

      .hero p {
        font-size: 16px;
      }

      .section-heading {
        font-size: 22px;
      }
    }

    @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
      *,
      *::before,
      *::after {
        scroll-behavior: auto !important;
        transition: none !important;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>

<body>
  <header class="site-header">
    <div class="header-inner">
      <a class="logo" href="/" aria-label="Toolnes homepage">Toolnes</a>

      <nav class="main-nav" aria-label="Main navigation">
        <a href="/">Home</a>
        <a href="/text-tools/">Text Tools</a>
        <a href="/calculators/">Calculators</a>
        <a class="active" href="/puzzles/" aria-current="page">Puzzles</a>
      </nav>
    </div>
  </header>

  <main class="container">
    <section class="hero">
      <span class="hero-label">FREE ONLINE GAMES</span>
      <h1>Free Online Puzzle Games</h1>
      <p>
        Take a break and challenge your brain with our collection of free
        online puzzles. Choose a game below and start playing.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section aria-labelledby="games-title">
      <h2 class="section-heading" id="games-title">Explore Puzzle Games</h2>

      <div class="games-grid">

        <article class="game-card">
          <div class="game-icon" aria-hidden="true">🔎</div>
          <h2>Word Search</h2>
          <p>
            Find hidden words in a letter grid and test your vocabulary
            and observation skills.
          </p>
          <a class="card-action" href="/puzzles/word-search/">
            Play Word Search →
          </a>
        </article>

        <article class="game-card">
          <div class="game-icon" aria-hidden="true">📝</div>
          <h2>Crossword Generator</h2>
          <p>
            Create crossword puzzles to challenge your vocabulary
            and enjoy a classic word game.
          </p>
          <span class="card-action disabled">Coming Soon</span>
        </article>

        <article class="game-card">
          <div class="game-icon" aria-hidden="true">🔢</div>
          <h2>Sudoku Generator</h2>
          <p>
            Exercise your logic with number puzzles suitable for
            different skill levels.
          </p>
          <span class="card-action disabled">Coming Soon</span>
        </article>

        <article class="game-card">
          <div class="game-icon" aria-hidden="true">🌀</div>
          <h2>Maze Generator</h2>
          <p>
            Find your way through a maze, solve the path,
            and challenge your problem-solving skills.
          </p>
          <span class="card-action disabled">Coming Soon</span>
        </article>

        <article class="game-card">
          <div class="game-icon" aria-hidden="true">🔤</div>
          <h2>Word Scramble</h2>
          <p>
            Rearrange mixed-up letters to discover the hidden words
            and improve your spelling.
          </p>
          <span class="card-action disabled">Coming Soon</span>
        </article>

        <article class="game-card">
          <div class="game-icon" aria-hidden="true">🎱</div>
          <h2>Bingo Generator</h2>
          <p>
            Generate bingo cards for parties, classrooms,
            family activities, and group games.
          </p>
          <span class="card-action disabled">Coming Soon</span>
        </article>

        <article class="game-card">
          <div class="game-icon" aria-hidden="true">🎮</div>
          <h2>2048 Game</h2>
          <p>
            Combine matching numbered tiles, reach 2048,
            and try to beat your highest score.
          </p>
          <a class="card-action" href="/puzzles/2048/">
            Play 2048 →
          </a>
        </article>

      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="info-section">
      <h2>Why Play Puzzle Games?</h2>
      <p>
        Puzzle games offer an enjoyable way to practise logical thinking,
        vocabulary, concentration, and problem-solving. Explore the available
        games on Toolnes and check back as more free puzzles are added.
      </p>
    </section>
  </main>

  <footer class="site-footer">
    <p>
      © <span id="current-year">2026</span> Toolnes.
      Free online tools and games.
    </p>
    <p><a href="/">Visit Toolnes Home</a></p>
  </footer>

  <script>
    document.getElementById("current-year").textContent =
      new Date().getFullYear();
  </script>
</body>
</html>
